Bind Npc 26056 Zone 1

On greeting
    If quest 220 is started and player has 910055000
        Say "I am the Seeker, the guardian of the Sixth key! You possess the [Fifth Key], so you are qualified to hear the question. Will you accept the challenge?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "Who was created out of confusion?"
            Topic "Cypher " do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910055000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. As a penalty, the [Fifth Key] you possessed has been destroyed. Now, I will leave to search for the secret of the keys elsewhere."
            Topic "Logos" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910055000
                    Give 1 of 910056000
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 220 is started
        Say "I am the Seeker, the Guardian of the Sixth Key! I only pose questions to those who bring the [Fifth Key]"
    Else
        Say ""
